name; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"function","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"line","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default."}]}]},{"name":"column","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is put in a session until the app turns it on, among the enrichers it builds its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker with, so every event the tracker tracks carries the key, through any copy of it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inactivity is measured between records’ timestamps, the time each event was tracked, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not when the tracker’s worker reaches it. So the app returning from the background past the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timeout starts a new session with its first event, such as "},{"code":"ApplicationOpened","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"LifecycleTracking","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and one returning sooner goes on with the same."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first event the tracker tracks starts the first session: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":" comes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it, stamped with its time. A session ends only when an event comes after the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timeout: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":", stamped with the time of the session’s last event, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":", stamped with the new event’s, come before that event. So a run’s last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session ends with no "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":": a destination takes its end from its last event. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session event carries the key of the session it starts or ends, and the context the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that ended the session had when this enricher reached it; the enrichers after this one run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on them too. Their call site is this call’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A session’s identifier is a version 7 UUID: the session’s start in Unix milliseconds, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"random bits, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. It is held in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this enricher’s memory and nowhere else: neither a store nor anything else writes it to disk,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a new enricher, as on the next launch, starts with a new session. Records a store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"kept from an earlier run aren’t enriched again, so they carry no key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher’s sessions are its own, created by this call: give each tracker its own call.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/NonPositiveSessionTimeout","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when "},{"code":"timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is zero or less."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enricher that puts every event in a session: it sets each record’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":" to its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session’s identifier, and starts a new session when an event comes "},{"code":"timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or more after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the one before it, tracking "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":" before that event."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/Events","doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/Events\/Enricher"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Putting events in sessions","anchor":"Putting-events-in-sessions","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/Events\/Enricher\/sessions(kinds:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEventKind","doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/NonPositiveSessionTime